    {
      "source": "Annotation that can be applied to a test class to enable and configure\nauto-configuration of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/servlet/MockMvc.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.servlet\"><code>MockMvc</code></a>. If AssertJ is available a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/servlet/assertj/MockMvcTester.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.servlet.assertj\"><code>MockMvcTester</code></a>\nis auto-configured as well.",
